oundsException` if `f1` has fewer positions than `BLOCK_LENGTH`. Furthermore, there is no check to ensure that `f1` or `f2` might be null before accessing their values.","nodes":[{"id":"benchmarks/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/benchmark/compute/operator/EvalBenchmark.java-benchmarks/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/benchmark/compute/operator/EvalBenchmark.java--13931:13956,13957:14466,14479:14505,14506:15129,15142:15167,15168:15795,18156:18165","promptId":"#Q77NA","srcPath":"benchmarks/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/benchmark/compute/operator/EvalBenchmark.java","dstPath":"benchmarks/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/benchmark/compute/operator/EvalBenchmark.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":13931,"endPos":13956,"startLine":293,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":293,"endLineOffset":37,"length":26},{"pos":13957,"endPos":14466,"startLine":293,"startLineOffset":38,"endLine":302,"endLineOffset":13,"length":510},{"pos":14479,"endPos":14505,"startLine":303,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":303,"endLineOffset":38,"length":27},{"pos":14506,"endPos":15129,"startLine":303,"startLineOffset":39,"endLine":313,"endLineOffset":13,"length":624},{"pos":15142,"endPos":15167,"startLine":314,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":314,"endLineOffset":37,"length":26},{"pos":15168,"endPos":15795,"startLine":314,"startLineOffset":38,"endLine":324,"endLineOffset":13,"length":628},{"pos":18156,"endPos":18165,"startLine":369,"startLineOffset":63,"endLine":369,"endLineOffset":72,"length":10}]}]},{"comment":"The `copyFrom` methods introduced in various block builders (BooleanBlockBuilder, BytesRefBlockBuilder, DoubleBlockBuilder, FloatBlockBuilder, IntBlockBuilder, LongBlockBuilder) are consistent and follow a similar pattern. However, ensure that the logic for handling null values (`block.isNull(position)`) is correctly implemented across all these methods to maintain consistency.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/compute/src/main/generated-src/org/elasticsearch/compute/data/IntBlockBuilder.java-x-